{"id": "EUVD-2026-81881", "enisaUuid": "61d4ae80-93b5-379e-95a0-d7f1ba7fc2df", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nphy: renesas: rcar-gen2: Fix double of_node_put on phy creation failure\n\nfor_each_child_of_node_scoped() releases the node reference on scope\nexit, so the explicit of_node_put(np) in the devm_phy_create() error\npath drops it twice.\n\nDrop the redundant of_node_put() and let the scoped cleanup handle it.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:08:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:01:06", "baseScore": 7.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5374f3d53376d35085e0727c8c1b945bf7123996", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b780b8929c759cfa7a892d58625a5ad46cb1cbd2"], "aliases": ["GHSA-c48g-9j8m-h9g5", "CVE-2026-90288"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.15, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0ddbb194-8370-37f2-870f-28da3f8d1308", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "5585cf60-de6b-313c-9587-2c90c8291a5d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.0"}, {"id": "7ee4ed1e-f7f7-36b7-b34a-c2515ff48245", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "9f8cc118-2962-3c5b-b663-99f6ffc1f3f3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "c7acda05-6630-3f1a-b85f-6a1d85cd876b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b64b32791fb557f922beebddf74c47baf338cef0 <b780b8929c759cfa7a892d58625a5ad46cb1cbd2"}, {"id": "df78a8cb-05b7-3b1e-b588-9327505afce3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b64b32791fb557f922beebddf74c47baf338cef0 <5374f3d53376d35085e0727c8c1b945bf7123996"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "86a3d5a1-1605-3e6d-ade1-ed3612b6ae62", "vendor": {"n